@startuml
' Snapshot: 2026-10-26. Solid implemented flow; proposed/deferred stages explicitly separated.
title Piping material lifecycle — implementation snapshot
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFF
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #E8F5EE
 BorderColor #277252
}
legend
 Green: implemented in workspace; NOT deployed
 Amber: D1–D3 issue design, awaiting approval; NOT implemented
 Grey: deferred/separate workflow
 Physical arrival, accepted credit, dispatch and actual consumption are different facts.
endlegend
start
partition "IMPLEMENTED — Physical receipt / QC / QA" {
 :Material controller / original nominated actor\nRecord actual arrival + custody / MRR\nMissing documents or failed inspection do not erase arrival;
 note right
 Independently configured custodian and four duties.
 Issued exact PIPING PO line must independently be visible
 before accepted posting; initially unlinked arrival is allowed.
 No source-reading grant is inherited.
 end note
 :Independent receiving QC\nRecord observations on exact effective receipt basis;
 :Independent QA acceptor\nManual decision + exact versioned evidence;
 while (Latest QA accepted AND all acceptance gates satisfied?) is (no)
   :HOLD / REJECTED\nRetain physical custody / quarantine\nNo accepted stock credit or ordinary consumption;
   :Resolve missing evidence / findings\nIf source or Heat changes: original preparer + live grant,\nappend-only amendment and fresh matching QC / QA;
   :Record required fresh QC / manual QA decision;
 endwhile (yes)
 note right
 MRR preparer, QC reviewer and QA acceptor are distinct.
 Accepted: six affirmative declarations, no open conditions,
 matching latest clean QC, known Heat, exact visible source
 and complete independently visible/intact pinned evidence.
 No waiver or automatic technical acceptance.
 end note
}
partition "IMPLEMENTED — Controlled GRN / separate accepted-stock ledger" {
 :Warehouse actor with independent current post_grn grant\nConfirm WHOLE receipt and accepted location / reason;
 while (Fresh authority / basis / evidence + exact-line ceiling\n+ no legacy source-PO lots + no duplicate posting?) is (blocked)
  :No new GRN / no new credit\nResolve cause; legacy reconciliation is separate\nNo automatic split, override or reversal;
  :Revalidate original caller, exact source and current posting gates;
 endwhile (pass)
 :ATOMIC TRANSACTION\nImmutable GRN + ONE accepted-stock credit\n+ derived posted marker;
 note right
 Decimal exact-line cumulative quantity <= ordered quantity.
 Identical authorized retry returns existing record, no second credit.
 Recorder company is preserved; no custodian impersonation.
 No legacy MaterialLot conversion or automatic PO/MTO update.
 Post-GRN QC / QA / source-Heat amendment is frozen pending
 a separately governed correction / reversal workflow.
 end note
}
partition "PROPOSED ONLY — D1 / D2 / D3, awaiting explicit approval" #FFF1D6 {
 #FFF1D6:Construction requester with separate issue nomination\nExact credit / Heat / unit, destination and purpose\nRequest and approval do NOT reserve stock;
 #FFF1D6:Independent technical release on exact request version\nCurrent condition / preservation / expiry / evidence\nUnknown required condition or open safety hold blocks dispatch;
 note right
 New duties/read adapters/readiness/hold model do not exist yet.
 Proposed requester != technical reviewer != dispatcher.
 Independent recipient nomination; recipient may be requester.
 A historical GRN is not perpetual proof of dispatch readiness.
 end note
 #FFF1D6:Independently nominated warehouse dispatcher\nFresh locked complete per-credit balance / authority / readiness\nAll submitted allocations post atomically or none\nONE controlled debit at actual warehouse handover;
 #FFF1D6:Separately nominated receiving company acknowledgment\nExact dispatched quantity / discrepancies\nReduce in-transit quantity ONLY — no second warehouse debit;
}
partition "DEFERRED / SEPARATELY GOVERNED" #EEF1F6 {
 #EEF1F6:Installation / actual consumption is NOT established by dispatch or receipt\nReturns, reversals, legacy reconciliation, transfer, scrap,\nfull preservation scheduler and remnant traceability remain separate;
}
stop
@enduml
